## 7. Vector Drawing

### 7.1 Line

```csharp
page.DrawLine(80, 680, 500, 680, lineWidth: 1.2, strokeColor: new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5));
```

### 7.2 Rectangle

```csharp
page.DrawRectangle(
    x: 80,
    y: 620,
    width: 420,
    height: 80,
    lineWidth: 1,
    fill: true,
    strokeColor: PdfColor.Gray,
    fillColor: new PdfCmykColor(0.2, 0, 0, 0));
```

---

## 8. Color System

All colors use `IPdfColor`.

Implementations:
- `PdfColor` (RGB, components 0..1)
- `PdfGrayColor` (grayscale, 0..1)
- `PdfCmykColor` (CMYK, each 0..1)

Examples:

```csharp
IPdfColor rgb = new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5);
IPdfColor gray = new PdfGrayColor(0.35);
IPdfColor cmyk = new PdfCmykColor(0.2, 0.1, 0, 0.05);
```

