## 10. Metadata

Set document info through `PdfDocument.Info`:

```csharp
document.Info.Title = "Invoice 2026-001";
document.Info.Author = "Accounting Service";
document.Info.Subject = "Invoice";
document.Info.Keywords = "invoice,billing";
document.Info.Creator = "Canvas.Pdf";
document.Info.Producer = ".NET 10 PDF Engine";
```

